+### 4.3 list_sessions
+
+Requests a page of conversation summaries for the authenticated user. The user id is taken from the connection and never from the frame, so an extra `userId` field cannot select another user's history ([validated by: answers list_sessions for the authenticated user with ISO dates, forwarding limit and before while ignoring any client userId](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L87)).
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "list_sessions",
+  "limit": 20,
+  "before": {"updatedAt": "2026-10-27T10:00:00.000Z", "sessionId": "session-3"}
+}
+```
+
+| Field | Type | Required | Description |
+|-------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `type` | string | Yes | `"list_sessions"` |
+| `limit` | number | No | Non-negative integer page size |
+| `before` | object | No | Cursor with `updatedAt` (ISO string or epoch number) and `sessionId` |
