+
+Answers `list_sessions` with summaries for the authenticated user. A summary contains metadata only; timestamps are ISO-8601 strings on the wire ([validated by: answers list_sessions for the authenticated user with ISO dates, forwarding limit and before while ignoring any client userId](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L87)).
