+| `type` | string | `"session_list"` |
+| `sessions` | array | Page of conversation summaries |
+
+Each summary has `sessionId` (string), `createdAt` (ISO-8601 string), `updatedAt` (ISO-8601 string), and `entryCount` (number). The server does not push `session_list` unsolicited. A store without `listFor` answers an empty `sessions` array; a store failure is answered with `SERVER_ERROR` ([validated by: answers an empty session_list when the store has no listFor, and SERVER_ERROR with a ws error log when listFor throws](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L129)).
